---
/** LearnHubble AI 학습자 화면: 보충 구간과 AI 힌트(정답 대신 비교 기준) */
import type { HomeContent } from '../../lib/content';
interface Props { t: HomeContent['story']['next']; label: string }
const { t, label } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="fx fx-hint" aria-label={label}>
  <div class="fx-bar"><span class="fx-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>{t.product}</b></div>
  <div class="fx-body">
    <span class="fx-chip blue">{t.chip}</span>
    <div class="fx-panel"><b>{t.panel}</b><p>{t.hint}</p><small>{t.source}</small></div>
    <p class="fx-done">{t.done}</p>
  </div>
</figure>
